From 455235ca0ec06bc35a099ca1f9ec7ee1943299a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wayne Maurer <wmaurer@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:12:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] test(foldkit): check produced Block declarations

The produced-block entry compares each produced shape with its assembled
Block: the key set and every member for the four completed shapes and
for replaceEffectsLayer and provideHandlers results, Block.AnyBlock,
embedView with and without a default view, and a Program root. It also
asserts the reason each invalid producer reports, and the rejected file
binds each invalid produced Block once.

Checks can now require text in their emitted declarations. The
produced-block entry requires that an exported produced Block is still
written as ProducedBlockWithView over its named producer, so emission
keeps the producer unresolved.
